OL,3,AJury deliberating in trial of Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy, US woman accused of killing her
OL,5,Achildren
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details and discussion of
OL,9,Fattempted suicide
OL,11,FThe fate of US mother Lindsay Clancy is
OL,12,Fnow in the hands of a Massachusetts
OL,13,Fjury, who must decide if she is guilty
OL,14,Fof first-degree murder - the
OL,15,Fintentional and premeditated killing of
OL,16,Fanother person - in the deaths of her
OL,17,Fthree children.
