OL,3,AJury deliberating in trial of Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy, US woman accused of killing her
OL,5,Achildren
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor five weeks, the trial has gripped
OL,8,Fthe country as Clancy's lawyers have
OL,9,Fargued that she was suffering from
OL,10,Fpostpartum psychosis when she killed
OL,11,Fher children, who ranged in age from
OL,12,Feight months to five years. Clancy does
OL,13,Fnot deny killing her two sons and
OL,14,Fdaughter.
OL,16,FThe prosecution argued she made a
OL,17,Fcalculated decision to intentionally
OL,18,Fmurder them.
